{"ID":"20240206113850-ngeo41b","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240206113850-ngeo41b","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206113850-ngeo41b\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206113858-8i6wxzb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206113854-ahwd0ng\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206113858-8i6wxzb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:142,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:142\u0026#125;","title":"忍冬藤","type":"doc","updated":"20240830170530"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206113858-8i6wxzb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206113858-8i6wxzb","updated":"20240206113903"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于河南、山东等地，目前全国大部分地区均由栽培。\n【性状】\t该品呈长圆柱形，多分枝，常缠绕成束，直径1.56mm。表面棕红色至暗棕色，有的灰绿色，光滑或被茸毛；外皮易剥落。枝上多节，节间长69cm，有残叶及叶痕。质脆，易折断，断面黄白色，中空。无臭，老枝味微苦，嫩枝味淡。\n【性味】\t甘，寒。\n【功效】\t清热解毒，疏风通络。用于温病发热，热毒血痢，痈肿疮疡，风湿热痹，关节红肿热痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240206113854-ahwd0ng","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206113854-ahwd0ng","updated":"20240206113854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206113853-ymgq4ef.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240714091831-lkpv836","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240714091831-lkpv836","updated":"20240714093637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 567px;","style":"width: 557px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"金银花 (13)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/金银花 13-20240714093631-lwawu2l.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]